{
  "id": "water_distribution_pipes___materials",
  "title": "Water Distribution Pipes - Materials",
  "description": "Materials used in water distribution pipes for potable water delivery inside buildings. Includes common piping materials and their corresponding U.S. standards.",
  "type": "calculator-chart",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Water Distribution Pipes - Materials\n\nA water-distribution pipe is located inside a building and delivers potable water to the fixtures. The supply system delivering water from the potable source to the building is the water service pipe.\n\n## Overview\n\nThe water distribution system includes normally both hot and cold water. The temperature range limits the materials allowed.\n\n**Standard Operating Conditions:**\n- Minimum working pressure: ~100 psi (7 bar)\n- Temperature rating: 180 °F (80 °C)\n\nIf the water-service pressure to the building exceeds the rated water-distribution pressure, a pressure-reducing valve must be installed.\n\n## Commonly Used Materials\n\n- Copper tube\n- Galvanized steel pipe\n- PB (polybutene)\n- PEX (cross-linked Polyethylene)"
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Piping Material",
        "US Standards"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Chlorinated polyvinyl chloride (CPVC) plastic pipe and tubing",
          "ASTM D2846; ASTM F441; ASTM F442; CSA B137.6"
        ],
        [
          "Chlorinated polyvinyl chloride/aluminum/chlorinated polyvinyl chloride (CPVC/AL/CPVC)",
          "ASTM F2855"
        ],
        [
          "Copper or copper-alloy pipe",
          "ASTM B42; ASTM B302; ASTM B43"
        ],
        [
          "Copper or copper-alloy tubing (Type K, WK, L, WL, M or WM)",
          "ASTM B75; ASTM B88; ASTM B251; ASTM B447"
        ],
        [
          "Cross-linked polyethylene (PEX) plastic tubing",
          "ASTM F876; CSA B137.5"
        ],
        [
          "Cross-linked polyethylene/aluminum/cross-linked polyethylene (PEX-AL-PEX) pipe",
          "ASTM F1281; ASTM F2262; CSA B137.10"
        ],
        [
          "Cross-linked polyethylene/aluminum/high-density polyethylene (PEX-AL-HDPE)",
          "ASTM F1986"
        ],
        [
          "Ductile iron pipe",
          "AWWA C151/A21.51; AWWA C115/A21.15"
        ],
        [
          "Galvanized steel pipe",
          "ASTM A53"
        ],
        [
          "Polyethylene/aluminum/polyethylene (PE-AL-PE) composite pipe",
          "ASTM F1282"
        ],
        [
          "Polyethylene of raised temperature (PE-RT) plastic tubing",
          "ASTM F2769; CSA B137.158"
        ],
        [
          "Polypropylene (PP) plastic pipe or tubing",
          "ASTM F2389; CSA B137.11"
        ],
        [
          "Stainless steel pipe (Type 304/304L)",
          "ASTM A312; ASTM A778"
        ],
        [
          "Stainless steel pipe (Type 316/316L)",
          "ASTM A312; ASTM A778"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "pipe_length",
          "label": "Pipe Length",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "feet",
          "defaultValue": 100
        },
        {
          "id": "pipe_diameter",
          "label": "Pipe Diameter",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "inches",
          "defaultValue": 0.75
        },
        {
          "id": "working_pressure",
          "label": "Working Pressure",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "psi",
          "defaultValue": 100
        },
        {
          "id": "water_temperature",
          "label": "Water Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "°F",
          "defaultValue": 68
        },
        {
          "id": "material_type",
          "label": "Pipe Material",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "cpvc",
              "label": "CPVC Plastic"
            },
            {
              "value": "copper",
              "label": "Copper Tube"
            },
            {
              "value": "pex",
              "label": "PEX Plastic"
            },
            {
              "value": "pex_al_pex",
              "label": "PEX-AL-PEX"
            },
            {
              "value": "galvanized",
              "label": "Galvanized Steel"
            },
            {
              "value": "stainless",
              "label": "Stainless Steel"
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": "copper"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "pipe_volume",
          "label": "Pipe Volume",
          "unit": "gallons",
          "formula": "inputs.pipe_length * 3.14159 * (inputs.pipe_diameter / 2) ^ 2 / 231",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "max_flow_rate",
          "label": "Estimated Max Flow Rate",
          "unit": "GPM",
          "formula": "inputs.pipe_diameter * inputs.working_pressure / 100 * 10",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "temperature_status",
          "label": "Temperature Status",
          "formula": "inputs.water_temperature <= 180 ? 'Within Standard (≤80°C/180°F)' : 'Exceeds Standard (>80°C/180°F)'",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "pressure_status",
          "label": "Pressure Status",
          "formula": "inputs.working_pressure <= 100 ? 'Standard Conditions' : 'Pressure Reducing Valve Recommended'",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}